Contents: of3_levers/of3_fastinit.py and of3_levers/of3_graphs.py replace OpenFold3 0.4.1 functions at import time (installed by
of3_levers/sitecustomize.py) — the weight-initialisation functions (core/model/primitives/initialization.py and primitives/linear.py, whose
headers print "Copyright 2026 AlQuraishi Laboratory" and "Copyright 2021 DeepMind Technologies Limited") and the diffusion denoising step
(core/model/structure/diffusion_module.py, header "Copyright 2026 AlQuraishi Laboratory", "Copyright 2026 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.",
"Copyright 2021 DeepMind Technologies Limited"; core/utils/atomize_utils.py, header "Copyright 2026 AlQuraishi Laboratory") — and are
modified works of the OpenFold3 statements they name in their module text, under the Apache License, Version 2.0; config/stock_predict.yml
is a configuration overlay over OpenFold3's configuration keys. No OpenFold3 source file is copied into this directory.
The barnase and barstar sequences in tests/public_inputs.py are the entity sequences of RCSB PDB entry 1BRS, embedded as string constants
with their provenance line (nothing is fetched at run time); PDB archive data are CC0 1.0 (wwPDB).
